+# Bug Fix: Product review privacy, validation, and aggregates
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T00:00:00+00:00
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Product reviews now expose only a first-name projection publicly, enforce authenticated customer ownership and correct conflict/error statuses, and scope merchant mutations to the URL product. Product review aggregates are recalculated from the current reviews after create, update, and delete with one-decimal half-up rounding.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-shop-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/model/catalog/product/ReadableProductReview.java` | modified | Dedicated public response fields and customer summary only |
+| `sm-shop-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/model/catalog/product/ReadableReviewCustomer.java` | added | First-name-only public author projection |
+| `sm-shop-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/model/catalog/product/ProductReviewEntity.java` | modified | Whole-number rating validation from 1 to 5 |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/product/ProductReviewApi.java` | modified | 403/409 handling, product scoping, and mapped errors |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/exception/{ConflictException,ForbiddenException}.java` | added | HTTP 409 and 403 exceptions |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/exception/RestErrorHandler.java` | modified | Maps new statuses and handles missing causes safely |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/catalog/product/review/ProductReviewServiceImpl.java` | modified | Recalculates average/count after writes and deletes |
+| `sm-core-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/model/catalog/product/review/ProductReview.java` | modified | Removes stale review descriptions during edits |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/populator/catalog/{Persistable,Readable}ProductReviewPopulator.java` | modified | Preserve update id and emit minimal public data |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/facade/product/ProductCommonFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Updates the managed review entity |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No dedicated review tests existed in the checkout; existing tests were run as regression coverage.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `./mvnw -pl sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` → passed.
+- Commands run: `./mvnw -pl sm-shop -am test -DskipITs` → passed; 61 tests ran, 21 skipped, 0 failures/errors.
+- Manual checks: `git diff --check` passed.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The fix added dedicated `ConflictException`, `ForbiddenException`, and public review-author DTO types, plus `orphanRemoval`, because the existing error model and broad customer DTO could not express the required behavior safely.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add focused MockMvc/integration fixtures for the review endpoints, including authenticated customer identities and product aggregate assertions.
